{
  "info": {
    "name": "Exportacion_ValetKey_Collection",
    "description": "Asynchronous Request-Reply + Valet Key: exportación del historial clínico a PDF y descarga con enlace temporal. Ejecutar en orden (Collection Runner o Send uno por uno). Los scripts guardan solos jwt, id_tarea y token.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000"
    },
    {
      "key": "id_mascota",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Parte A - Asynchronous Request-Reply",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "A0 - Iniciar sesión como veterinario",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Login correcto (200)\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"jwt_vet\", pm.response.json().access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Inicia sesión y guarda el JWT en la variable jwt_vet.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"correo\": \"bruno.vet@petcore.com\",\n  \"contrasena\": \"Password123!\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "A1 - Iniciar exportación (202 Accepted)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 202 Accepted\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "pm.test(\"Responde rápido (< 1000 ms), sin esperar al PDF\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(1000));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Estado inicial PENDIENTE\", () => pm.expect(j.estado).to.eql(\"PENDIENTE\"));",
                  "pm.test(\"Devuelve id_tarea\", () => pm.expect(j.id_tarea).to.be.a(\"string\"));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"id_tarea\", j.id_tarea);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"intentos\", \"0\");"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/historial/{{id_mascota}}/exportar",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "historial",
                "{{id_mascota}}",
                "exportar"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Async Request-Reply: la API debe responder 202 enseguida, sin esperar a que se genere el PDF. Guarda id_tarea.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{jwt_vet}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "A2 - Otra solicitud mientras la exportación sigue pendiente",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"La API sigue atendiendo (200)\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Responde rápido (< 1000 ms)\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(1000));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/demo/instancia",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "demo",
                "instancia"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Se envía justo después de A1. La API debe seguir respondiendo con normalidad mientras el PDF se genera en segundo plano. (GET /mascotas no sirve: el rol VETERINARIO recibe 403.)",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{jwt_vet}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "A3 - Consultar estado (polling)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Responde 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "const n = (parseInt(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"intentos\")) || 0) + 1;",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"intentos\", String(n));",
                  "console.log(\"Intento \" + n + \": \" + j.estado);",
                  "if (j.estado === \"PENDIENTE\" && n < 30) {",
                  "  setTimeout(() => {}, 1000);",
                  "  postman.setNextRequest(pm.info.requestName);",
                  "} else {",
                  "  pm.test(\"La exportación terminó en LISTO\", () => pm.expect(j.estado).to.eql(\"LISTO\"));",
                  "  pm.test(\"Incluye enlace_descarga con Valet Key\", () => pm.expect(j.enlace_descarga).to.include(\"token=\"));",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"enlace_descarga\", j.enlace_descarga);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token_valet\", j.enlace_descarga.split(\"token=\")[1]);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/historial/exportar/{{id_tarea}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "historial",
                "exportar",
                "{{id_tarea}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Repetir con Send hasta ver LISTO. En el Collection Runner se repite solo (cada 1 s, máx. 30 veces). Con LISTO guarda el enlace y el token de Valet Key.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{jwt_vet}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Parte B - Valet Key",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "B1 - Descargar con Valet Key, SIN JWT (200)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Descarga permitida (200)\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Es un PDF\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get(\"Content-Type\")).to.include(\"application/pdf\"));",
                  "pm.test(\"El archivo no está vacío\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.responseSize).to.be.above(500));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}{{enlace_descarga}}",
            "description": "Sin encabezado Authorization. El token temporal alcanza para descargar este PDF.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "B2 - Crear una segunda exportación (tarea B)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"202 Accepted\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"id_tarea_b\", pm.response.json().id_tarea);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/historial/{{id_mascota}}/exportar",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "historial",
                "{{id_mascota}}",
                "exportar"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Prepara el escenario del recurso incorrecto. Guarda id_tarea_b.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{jwt_vet}}",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "B3 - Recurso incorrecto: token de la tarea A en la tarea B (403)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Rechazado con 403\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(403));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/historial/exportar/{{id_tarea_b}}/descargar?token={{token_valet}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "historial",
                "exportar",
                "{{id_tarea_b}}",
                "descargar"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_valet}}"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "El token está ligado a una tarea concreta; usarlo en otra debe rechazarse.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "B4 - Token alterado (401)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Rechazado con 401\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/historial/exportar/{{id_tarea}}/descargar?token={{token_valet}}x",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "historial",
                "exportar",
                "{{id_tarea}}",
                "descargar"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{token_valet}}x"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Se le agrega un carácter al token: la firma ya no coincide.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "B5 - Token vencido (401) - requiere VALET_KEY_SEGUNDOS corto",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// Espera 11 segundos para que el enlace (VALET_KEY_SEGUNDOS=10) venza antes de usarlo.",
                  "setTimeout(function () {}, 11000);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Enlace vencido (401)\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "pm.test(\"El mensaje indica vencimiento\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().detail).to.include(\"venció\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{base_url}}{{enlace_descarga}}",
            "description": "Espera 11 segundos y vuelve a usar el enlace de B1. Da 401 si la API se levantó con VALET_KEY_SEGUNDOS=10. Con la duración por defecto (10 minutos) devuelve 200.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
